<title>UK: LUKoil sets $200 mln five-year convertible bond.</title>
<headline>LUKoil sets $200 mln five-year convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers and bookrunners NatWest, Paribas and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LUKOIL</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON   **3.5-4.0   MATURITY   *     2002</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 IND PREM    20-25 PCT</p>
<p>NOTES  **INDICATED. *CALLABLE FROM YEAR THREE AT ACCRETED VALUE SUBJECT TO 140 PCT HURDLE. CONVERTIBLE INT LONDON-LISTED GDRS OF LUKOIL. REDEMPTION AT A PRICED TO YIELD 125-175 BP OVER UST</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p> NOTES	PRICING WEEK OF APRIL 14</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
